[SIZE="4"][B]Device information[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*]Device: LG L4 II (LG-E440g), codename vee4ss
[*]SoC: MediaTek MT6575, Cortex-A9
[*]Display: 320x480 HVGA, command-mode DSI panel (ili9486)
[*]Touchscreen: Imagis IST30xx
[*]Storage: eMMC (system mmcblk0p8, cache mmcblk0p9, data mmcblk0p10)
[*]Stock Android: 4.1.2 Jelly Bean, firmware E44010a
[*]Kernel: stock LG Linux 3.4.0
[/LIST]

[SIZE="4"][B]Bug reports[/B][/SIZE]

Include your exact model and stock firmware, what you did, what happened, and [I]/tmp/recovery.log[/I] ([I]adb pull /tmp/recovery.log[/I]). Do not report issues from other L4 II variants.

